WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:10.480
<b>Episode 7: Amamiya Yuuhi and the Beast Knights (Part 1)</b>

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:10.900
Holding Field:

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.630
Inclined Plane!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.250
So that's your power, huh?

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:31.880
Well, I can't very well go without 
showing you mine, too, now can I?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.790
<i>How is it so big?</i>

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.110
Holding Field:

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.320
Aerial Domain!

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:39.960
This is...

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.930
Now, let's go!

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.980
<i>I don't have a plan, but...</i>

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.560
<i>I'm here to protect her, to save her!</i>

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:50.980
<i>I'll be a hero!</i>

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:04.870
That was...!

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:11.260
You're already in my stomach!

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:13.420
Now sit back and get digested!

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.120
<i>Three-dimensional movement...</i>

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.500
<i>That's too much trouble.</i>

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:35.070
Hah! That was fun, Nagumo-san!

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:38.140
Incredible.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.460
He threw it again.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.110
Just like...

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:43.260
the Whirlwind.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.160
S-So that's what it was!

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.060
Neu.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:01:58.970
Does this...

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.100
mean what I think?

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.380
The golem from before!

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.050
<i>It's different from before!</i>

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.630
Princess?!

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.890
No way! It withstood our Princess's blow?!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.730
<i>It has seven eyes.</i>

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:52.900
I-It's a monster.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.070
Shut up!

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.240
Impossible!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.750
She's on a whole different level.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.710
Yuu-kun, you okay?

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.830
Huh? Oh, yes.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.420
He saved me again.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.700
What's wrong?

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:23.000
We found out what Shinonome-dono wished for

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:27.400
with his Knight's pact right before he died.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:33.280
Pass the skills of Shinonome Hangetsu 
on to Amamiya Yuuhi.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.990
Shinonome-san's...

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:41.290
I was saved... by Shinonome-san, 
a dead person.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:47.540
Even though... I was sick 
of being saved by others.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:52.120
Princess, Yuuhi has become stronger.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.200
<i>It wasn't until now</i>

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.350
<i>that I finally shed tears for my friend.</i>

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:09.240
Please don't cry.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:13.730
If you hadn't come I would have died.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.810
Thank you for saving me.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.740
Crying isn't the look of a hero!

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.810
You're welcome.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:40.950
Shinonome-san, thank you.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:45.930
<i>Everyone was crying</i>

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.390
<i>Like a star burning blue</i>

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.770
<i>Where will we go? What will we see?</i>

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:57.570
<i>We're all going to change, though.</i>

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.990
<i>I don't need it, don't want it.</i>

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.100
<i>I've already given up on it</i>

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.760
<i>After so many sad farewells</i>

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:21.140
<i>And "take cares"</i>

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:26.460
<i>I want to like the present more than the past, 
the future more than the present.</i>

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:30.550
<i>Gradually my values have changed</i>

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:34.020
<i>I felt more grown up the more they wore away</i>

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:39.910
<i>Lies and betrayals 
are practically civilities</i>

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:43.410
<i>Everyone ages</i>

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:46.890
<i>But what about the star burning blue?</i>

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:50.230
<i>Our likes and dislikes</i>

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:53.830
<i>They'll all change at some point</i>

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:56.700
<i>A worn-out savior</i>

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.380
<i>A medal in a dirty ditch</i>

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:02.210
<i>I don't want to overlook 
their faint glimmers of light</i>

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:06.010
<i>I hear the sound still ringing from them</i>

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:11.530
<i>Let's move on a bit</i>

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.250
<i>I had a dream.</i>

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.510
<i>I was surrounded on all sides by sky.</i>

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:23.920
<i>I couldn't tell if I was falling or ascending, 
but I was certain of one thing.</i>

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.440
<i>I could now make this sky my garden.</i>

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:39.040
What are you doing, 
grabbing a woman's face all of a sudden?!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.410
It's your fault for intruding on my dream.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.210
So, did you need something?

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:50.670
Well, you've gotten stronger, 
so I thought I'd give you a reward.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.780
A reward?

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.210
Don't look.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:02.730
I... I'm grateful, but I'll refrain.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:05.810
I have gotten stronger,

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:08.150
but it wasn't something I achieved myself.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.990
Why are you arching back 
as soon as you wake up?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.250
I had a dream that I made the wrong choice.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.410
Hmm, what kind of dream?

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.630
Uhh... Huh?

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:28.210
Another dream I forgot as soon as I woke?

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.570
Oh, a horse... I mean, Nagumo-dono.

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:40.180
That pairing really stands out.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.920
Good morning, Amamiya.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.100
On your way to college?

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.270
Yes.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.650
Mikazuki attends the same college, right?

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:49.330
Yes. Um, that injury?

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:51.680
Yeah, it's from Mikazuki.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.540
He's a berserker.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.910
Seems he absolutely loves fighting.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:08:00.570
So if he challenges you when things 
are peaceful, accept as often as you can.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.200
Huh?

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:05.710
You're not here to warn us 
about how dangerous Mikazuki is?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:10.310
If he interferes when a golem attacks, 
then two Beast Knights,

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:12.920
Mikazuki and the one he challenges,

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:15.640
are taken out of the battle as a result.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.270
I want to avoid that.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:23.490
Also, do you mind if I share 
your contact info with Hakudou?

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:26.060
She said she wanted to 
thank you for saving her.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:27.880
Thank me? That's fine.

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:30.030
Good. That's all from me.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.470
That must be hard on you, though.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.150
Getting your face hurt like that...

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.950
I imagine it must be interfering 
with your normal job.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.950
Oh, don't worry.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.580
I'm unemployed.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.460
Oh, okay.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:53.090
Yuu-kun, want to work out some?

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.300
You've gotten stronger, after all.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.180
Why not take it for a test drive?

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:57.940
Nope.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:59.140
Huh?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.430
Hey, Yuuhi.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.930
I know Nagumo-san is right,

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:06.990
but the princess has forbidden me 
from any personal fights.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:13.090
Isn't this a chance to test 
how much stronger you've become?

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.380
How much stronger?

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:18.530
I've inherited Shinonome-san's skills.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.130
I'm invincible, obviously.

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:31.630
A number I don't recognize?

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.750
Hello?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.720
<i>Amamiya-kun? It's Hakudou.</i>

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:37.470
What's up?

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:40.650
<i>I wanted to thank you for saving me.</i>

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:42.120
Oh, no, it's fine...

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.480
<i>Are you free tonight?</i>

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:47.810
<i>Am I free tonight?</i>

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:53.990
I am.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.380
<i>That's great!</i>

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.840
<i>In that case... Ah!</i>

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.280
Hakudou-san?! What happened?!

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.160
This woman is mine now.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.660
<i>M-Mikazuki?!</i>

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:10.160
If you want her back, then come 
to the location I'm about to tell you.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.560
I'm glad you came!

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.590
Now, let's fight, Yuu-kun!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:16.770
Where's Hakudou-san?

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:18.160
She went to buy some tea.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:21.030
Can I go home?

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.590
Try it and see what happens!

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:23.910
There'll be tears! Mine!

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:25.780
Cry all you want.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:29.060
You devil! You're heartless! 
Your blood is Blue Hawaii!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.450
Oh, Amamiya-kun.

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.150
Hey, Amami.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.290
Hello.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:36.290
Welcome back, ma'am.

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:38.200
He's even being polite to her.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.990
This is such a farce.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.730
Stop saying that and fight him.

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:45.690
He's the younger brother 
of Shinonome Hangetsu,

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.740
the man you inherited 
your skills from, right?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:54.490
There's a chance Hangetsu didn't pass 
those skills on solely for your sake, Amami.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.910
All right. I'll do it.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.800
Mikazuki.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:10.870
<i>You said you wanted to 
surpass Shinonome-san, right?</i>

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:20.510
<i>Then I'll become your hurdle in his stead.</i>

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:35.130
Finished?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.460
No way!

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:37.790
Oh?

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.370
Oh, boy. So weak.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:53.460
It's like your mind, body, 
and skills are out of sync.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.250
Were you trying to be my 
brother while you fought?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:01.400
I mean, do you even know what you 
want to do in the first place, Yuu-kun?

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:04.070
<i>That's obvious.</i>

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.880
<i>Destroy the Earth with the Princess's fist.</i>

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.330
<i>Hmm? Why am I picturing everyone?</i>

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:14.440
Well now, I'm going to take a shower.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.250
Are you okay?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.110
Yeah.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:23.870
<i>Oh, I get it. I must be...</i>

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:25.560
Want to lean on me?

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:28.040
No, I can walk.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.230
Hey!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.010
Come look over here, over here.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:34.900
That's...

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:39.580
The seven-eyed golem 
the Princess sent flying.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:42.710
It's real intense seeing it this close.

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:43.960
Wonder if it's safe to climb.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.880
I wouldn't do that.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:48.540
<i>What is this bad feeling?</i>

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:52.690
Get back, it's alive!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:01.440
And, there.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.480
Wha?!

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:09.610
Good work, Hekatombaion.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.460
You must be tired from serving as a gate.

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:14.190
You should get some rest.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.680
H-He's floating?

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:19.610
Hey.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.160
Good work to you all, as well.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:25.680
I'll give you some time, so take a break.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.090
I imagine the previous ones 
were a piece of cake for you,

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:33.030
but it's going to get tougher, 
now that we're in the middle stretch.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:34.580
Well, see you later.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.790
H-He showed himself.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:40.750
He is the mage, Animus.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:46.740
Yuu-kun.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:49.240
Yuu-kun, wake up.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:50.510
It's already afternoon.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:52.460
Princess?

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.100
What a weird face.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.350
Wake up!

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.330
Here're your glasses.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.190
You awake now?

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.040
Sorry for intruding.

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:05.790
Good morning.

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.360
Don't "good morning" me!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.490
Hey, why is the horse in here?!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.640
I thought I'd introduce our ally.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.580
We don't need the horse!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.540
This is the Black Cat Knight, 
Shimaki Hyou and Kuh Ritter.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:22.400
The Black Cat Knight, Shimaki Hyou...

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:24.570
<i>I'm Shimaki Hyou.</i>

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:25.960
A stage name?

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.930
Nice to meet you. I'm Kuh.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.040
A cat.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:32.060
A black cat, so cool!

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:33.600
Hey.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.550
I'm Shimaki!

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.230
Nice to meet you.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:47.700
Hmm, cramped and hot, 
just like a student's room should be.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.400
I felt the same way.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.010
Um, can we just take this outside for now?

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.050
Dance is outside?

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:01.280
I couldn't exactly bring him 
inside the restaurant.

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:04.420
Then why did you bring him into my room?

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:07.770
I heard you were there 
when the mage appeared.

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:09.840
Are you listening to me?

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.080
Seconds!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.310
The seven-eyed golem...

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:16.180
It was still alive, too.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.810
That golem that combined together?

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:22.990
I hope we have great numbers on
our side the next time we encounter it.

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:28.080
Why weren't you able to 
make it last time, Shimaki-san?

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:31.000
Hyou-kun was far away due to work.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.030
And the Owl Knight?

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.480
He's a child.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.290
I can't make him fight.

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:38.280
<i>A child?</i>

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.140
I'd like to gather all of 
the Beast Knights together

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.760
before the seven-eyed one attacks again.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:49.470
The seven-eyed one 
is the sixth I've encountered.

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:53.240
But the golems have had one more 
eye each time I faced them.

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:56.550
So there's likely one more 
we haven't seen yet.

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:59.700
If that rule holds true,

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:03.640
then there're other Knights 
who already have combat experience.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:09.720
The seven-eyed one wouldn't show up, 
unless they had defeated that other golem.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.860
I just hope they didn't die killing it.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.670
Shimaki-san and I are 
heading out for some ramen.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.890
Oh, sure. Later.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.630
They're still eating more?

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.210
<i>I have a ton of things to consider now.</i>

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:29.810
<i>The mage, Animus, has finally 
made his appearance.</i>

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:33.030
<i>Then there're the remaining Knights, and...</i>

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:43.290
<i>I can't stay like this.</i>

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:48.320
<i>If I remain this slow, the skills 
Shinonome-san passed on will just—</i>

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.330
Hakudou-san.

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.300
Good evening.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.140
Hey.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:57.830
As thanks for the other day,

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.690
I thought I'd make you dinner.

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.940
Thank you.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.810
Come on in.

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.460
Pardon me.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.420
Yuu-kun, teach me math!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.820
My, Princess. Good evening.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:17.260
Oh, uh... Hakudou-san.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:21.220
I'm about to start making dinner, 
but would you like to join us?

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.140
I would.

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.740
That was great!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:30.980
That was good.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.220
Really? I'm glad.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:37.450
I've got a lot of visitors today.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:41.990
Hey! I found two more Knights!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.630
Praise me, praise me!

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:44.450
Huh?

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:45.430
Oh, my.

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:46.490
Well done!

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:49.120
Come on, that girl's our Princess.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:53.660
Hello. I'm Tsukishiro Yukimachi.

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.540
I'm Long Yue.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:57.340
We're the Turtle Knight.

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:01.020
Hoshikawa Subaru! The Rooster Knight!

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:02.810
I'm Ly Soleil!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.940
Mhm, nice to meet you!

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:06.520
So cute!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:08.600
Th-They're children.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.540
Don't underestimate us, lizard bastard!

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:14.500
You wouldn't believe it, but these two 
have already defeated a golem!

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:15.460
Stop it!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:17.610
We didn't do it ourselves.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:20.520
It was because Master was with us.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:23.370
Master?

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:25.810
Another Knight.

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:29.600
He died protecting us.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:33.340
He was a warrior amongst warriors!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.610
I see.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.800
So another one already died in battle.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:41.260
Do you know which Knight he was?

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:42.940
The Fish.

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:43.560
Huh?

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.470
And the Sword!

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:48.810
Uh?

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:52.230
Master was the Swordfish Knight.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.870
The Swordfish Knight?!

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:58.620
<i>This tale about shattering the planet</i>

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:03.560
<i>was set in a world of absolute chaos.</i>

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:07.660
There are twelve Beast Knights total.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.340
That just leaves two more.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:13.740
So then, what about the three 
Mythic Beast Knights you mentioned before?

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:15.880
Don't know, not sure.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:17.860
You don't know?

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:21.760
Huh?

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:23.800
Huh?

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.480
Are you...

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.960
All the Beast Knights have been found?

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.430
You ran into them on the street?

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:34.370
<i>Got it.</i>

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:36.950
<i>Contact everyone and 
gather them all together.</i>

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:37.940
As you wish!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:55.210
So you're the last two?

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:58.140
I'm the Mouse Knight, Kusakabe Tarou.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.590
And I'm Lance Lumiere.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.020
I'm the Mantis Knight, Sorano Hanako.

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:06.180
My name is Kir Sonne.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.100
Tarou and Hanako, huh?

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.390
Those are rare names nowadays.

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:13.890
There's another kid besides us.

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:14.980
You're right.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.040
Hey!

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:23.820
I'm the Owl Knight, Akane Taiyou.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.100
I'm Loki Helios.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.100
Nice to meet you.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:31.760
So what are we all getting together for?

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:34.040
So everyone can meet each other,

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.750
and because the Princess 
has an announcement.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.000
Huh...

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.710
Yuu-kun, you've gotten strong.

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:45.400
You've made friends, saved others, 
and shed tears for them.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:48.810
Do you still hate this world?

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:50.420
Yes.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.890
Can you love this world?

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:54.860
Yes.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.150
I love this world, too.

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.440
That's why I want it.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:05.040
And I'll shatter it with my 
own hand to obtain it.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:10.560
Yuu-kun, no matter what choices you 
make after coming to love this world,

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.080
I'll still love you along with it.

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:18.430
Even if you try and stop me 
in the final battle.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:22.090
I belong to you.

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:26.970
I would gladly offer you 
this planet that I love.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:30.600
I love you, my Lucifer Knight.

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:33.360
I love you, my Lucifer.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.060
<i>All the actors have finally been assembled.</i>

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:46.680
<i>And my role in this tale of the 
planet's destruction is set in stone.</i>

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:49.610
Huh? This is everyone?

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:52.450
Yeah. We've already lost a few.

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:54.820
For real?!

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:56.400
Tarou-kun.

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.750
I-I'm not scared!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:00.420
The enemy is powerful.

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:03.690
We can't avoid people dying.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:06.770
Are you scared of our enemy?

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:09.390
Do not fear him!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:13.140
The moment we succumb to despair in the 
face of his might is the moment we die!

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.310
So do not despair!

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:18.100
Cling to hope and the future ahead of you!

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:23.130
Fight not for the sake of the planet, 
the sake of mankind, or the sake of duty!

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:26.040
Fight only to keep yourself alive!

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:29.240
Fight only to keep your friends alive!

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:32.550
Use all of your luck, 
your talent, and your hard work

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:35.460
to live through today and through tomorrow!

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:36.950
That is who we are!

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:39.090
The Beast Knights!

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:44.900
<i>I'll keep my role secret until the very end,</i>

00:22:46.580 --> 00:22:48.010
<i>and see this act through.</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:05.230
<i>Looking back to those times, 
I always thought</i>

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>It was hard to live life true to myself.</i>

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:13.520
<i>I recall those times.</i>

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:17.090
<i>I wanted to forget, 
but now it's different.</i>

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:22.770
<i>Back then we stared at that same sky.</i>

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:29.500
<i>I'll never forget you, 
or our endless dreams</i>

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:36.010
<i>As we gazed at that sky 
after fate brought us together</i>

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:41.460
<i>I dream of us together, 
of those days I remember</i>

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:43.730
<i>But dreams end and I wake up</i>

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:48.250
<i>Seeking the future</i>

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:54.300
<i>I reach for the light,</i>

00:23:55.220 --> 00:24:00.720
<i>Always thinking of you in</i>

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:13.620
<i>every little thing</i>

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:27.460
<b>\h\h\hNext Episode:
Amamiya Yuuhi and the Beast Knights (Part 2)</b>
